{"deep_convolutional_neural_network": "Deep convolutional neural network is a type of artificial neural network that uses convolutional layers to analyze data. It is particularly effective in processing grid-like data such as images and, in this context, electroencephalogram (EEG) signals.|Here is another description: A Deep convolutional neural network is a type of artificial neural network that uses convolutional layers to analyze data. It is particularly effective in processing grid-like data such as images and, in this case, time-series data like EEG signals. The network is designed to automatically and adaptively learn spatial hierarchies of features from the input data, making it suitable for tasks like pattern recognition and classification."},
