{"department_of_electronics_and_computer_engineering_ngee_ann_polytechnic_599489_singapore": "The Department of Electronics and Computer Engineering at Ngee Ann Polytechnic is an academic department focused on the study and application of electronics and computer engineering. Located in Singapore, it is part of Ngee Ann Polytechnic, an institution known for its technical and vocational education, offering programs and research opportunities in various engineering disciplines."},
