{"100_data_from_5_epileptic_patients": "The object \"100 data from 5 epileptic patients\" refers to the total number of EEG recordings included in the preictal class, which are derived from five individuals diagnosed with epilepsy. These recordings were made when the patients were not experiencing a seizure."},
