{"research": "Research refers to the systematic investigation and study of materials, sources, or any subject in order to establish facts and reach new conclusions. In the context provided, it specifically pertains to the scholarly and experimental work conducted to explore and understand the application of Convolutional Neural Networks (CNN) in analyzing physiological signals."},
