{"normal_preictal_or_seizure": "The object \"normal, preictal, or seizure\" represents the three possible categories into which the input EEG signal can be classified. \"Normal\" indicates typical brain activity, \"preictal\" refers to the period before a seizure, and \"seizure\" indicates abnormal brain activity during a seizure."},
