{"summary_of_details_of_the_proposed_cnn_structure": "The summary of details of the proposed CNN structure includes specific parameters such as kernel sizes, the number of layers, types of layers (convolutional, max-pooling, and fully connected), and operational settings like stride values. This summary provides a clear and comprehensive overview of the CNN's architecture and functionality."},
