{"graphical_representation_of_cnn_structure_with_4097_input_sample_lengths": "The graphical representation of the CNN structure with 4097 input sample lengths is a visual depiction of the proposed CNN architecture. It includes various layers such as convolutional, max-pooling, and fully connected layers, each represented by different colors to signify their functions within the network."},
