{"feature_map_in_layer_6": "The feature map in Layer 6 represents the output of the previous convolutional and max-pooling operations in the CNN architecture. It is a set of data that has been transformed through multiple layers of convolution and pooling, reducing the dimensionality and extracting relevant features from the input EEG signals."},
