{"lambda": "Lambda is a regularization parameter used in training machine learning models, specifically in this context, a Convolutional Neural Network (CNN) for EEG signal processing and seizure detection. It is one of the key parameters that can be adjusted to optimize the model's performance.|Here is another description: Lambda, in the context of training a Convolutional Neural Network (CNN), is a regularization parameter used to prevent overfitting. It is one of the key parameters that can be tuned to optimize the model's performance on a given dataset."},
