{"chua_et_al__combined__hos_and_entropy_features_with_gmm_classifier": "The predicate \"combined\" refers to the action taken by Chua et al. in their research where they integrated two different types of features\u2014higher order spectra (HOS) and entropy\u2014to enhance the performance of their Gaussian mixture model (GMM) classifier in EEG signal classification."},
