{"multifractal_analysis_for_seizure_detection_in_intracranial_eeg_using_svm": "Multifractal analysis for seizure detection in intracranial EEG using SVM refers to a research approach where multifractal analysis, a method used to analyze the complexity and irregularities in data, is applied to intracranial EEG signals. The Support Vector Machine (SVM) is used as a classifier to detect seizures, aiming to improve the accuracy and reliability of seizure detection in EEG data."},
